{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>דברת</b> — Two times in the Masorah: here and the other: ואני אשימם דוברות בים (1 Kings 9:27). דוברות שהיו מלאות רוח אלהים וחכמות כים שהוא מלא — that they were full of the spirit of Elohim and wisdom like the sea, which is full. As they interpreted: חכמניות היו דרשניות היו — they were wise women, they were exegetes."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:16.009022478Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}